Package: cleanTMLE
Title: Outcome-Blind Design and Estimand Selection for Targeted Learning
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andrew", "Mertens", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "amertens@berkeley.edu"),
    person("cleanTMLE Contributors", role = "ctb"))
Description: Declares an analysis plan, locks the design data without the
    outcome, checks by outcome-free plasmode simulation which estimands the
    design can deliver and which targeted maximum likelihood candidate to
    use for each, records that decision in a hashed dossier, and only then
    admits the outcome for estimation. Weighting and matching are offered
    as comparators.
